sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Console
  participant GW as gateway /ask
  participant DB as Postgres
  participant L as LLM
  U->>GW: POST /ask {question}
  GW->>GW: embed question (local ONNX)
  GW->>DB: knowledge version (tenant documents fingerprint)
  GW->>DB: nearest cached answer (tenant, model, version, < 24 h)
  alt similarity ≥ 0.95
    GW-->>U: answer + citations (cached: true)
  else miss
    GW->>DB: hybrid search top 5
    GW->>L: system + numbered excerpts + question
    L-->>GW: answer citing [n]
    GW->>DB: store in cache
    GW-->>U: answer + citations (cached: false)
  end
